    "summary": "When you select this unit to shoot with **[close-quarters shooting](vsdata:core-rule/close-quarters-shooting)** in your **[Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase)**, its attacks against a unit that is engaged with it may ignore any modifiers to BS and to Hit rolls. Also, for each of its **[[BLAST]](vsdata:weapon-ability/blast)** weapons you may choose that the weapon loses [BLAST], which restricts that weapon to targeting an enemy unit with which no other friendly unit is engaged.",
